OL,3,GNEWSAChoir hits high notes in New York
OL,4,Afor 10th birthday
OL,5,
OL,6,FAn amateur choir has taken its 10th
OL,7,Fbirthday celebrations to new heights -
OL,8,Fsinging from the top of the Empire
OL,9,FState Building in New York City.
OL,11,FNinety-eight members of Somewhere 2
OL,12,FSing made the 3,500 miles (5,600km)
OL,13,Fjourney to perform at three of the Big
OL,14,FApple's best-known landmarks, including
OL,15,FOne World Observatory (former World
OL,16,FTrade Center site) and the Intrepid
OL,17,FMuseum.
OL,23,APub: 10-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB E Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
