OL,2,W//%*// //%Q-, *,$%**,%-,* %%**,! ,,,,,,
OL,3,GNEWSAChoir hits high notes in New York
OL,4,Afor 10th birthday
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe choir, which began with two small
OL,7,Fgroups in Hertford and Stevenage in
OL,8,F2016, has expanded to 1,000 members in
OL,9,F18 locations across Bedfordshire,
OL,10,FEssex, Hertfordshire and Suffolk.
OL,12,FFounder Duncan Rutherford said it was a
OL,13,Fproud moment, adding: "I never dreamed
OL,14,Fwe'd have grown so much and have this
OL,15,Fincredible experience."
